es bearing an eerie message visited his dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Executioner...your first and final trial waits for you there...at the temple.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It didn't mean anything. At least not then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997900/extras/0360244ecdb48563e62a9111db846971.avif?t=1771054941\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Divine Omen, even the most innocuous choices can shape the fates of your companions. The messages in Avan's dreams serve as your guide. Listen carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997900/extras/f49ff748146011a02ab26391abf9b313.avif?t=1771054941\" width=600 height=235 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997900/extras/89bde64239190f07fd25eef5bebd6de7.avif?t=1771054941\" width=600 height=235 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997900/extras/14cf7e04a2702059d4bae4f4b4c1973f.avif?t=1771054941\" width=600 height=235 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997900/extras/fda50af898d9a49cb21af95be672c09e.avif?t=1771054941\" width=600 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997900/extras/ddc4bff803f09f84843317dad603cfb3.avif?t=1771054941\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C